@*
    OdsDonutPair — two donut panels as separate recessed wells in a 2-up grid
    (Odyssey Design System · components/Donut · Donut.Pair; mirrors the kit
    .acct-donuts-row / .bgt-donuts-row restructure that replaced the single
    center divider).

    The account-overview layout (assets / liabilities, planned-in / planned-out).
    Use stacked panels inside — give each child OdsDonut Layout="OdsDonutLayout.Stack"
    so the two columns aren't too wide. Each panel sits in its own .odc-donut-card
    well; the row collapses to a single column at ≤760px.
*@

<div class="odc-donut-pair">
    @if (First is not null)
    {
        <div class="odc-donut-card">@First</div>
    }
    @if (Second is not null)
    {
        <div class="odc-donut-card">@Second</div>
    }
    @ChildContent
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>The left panel (typically an OdsDonut with Layout=Stack).</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? First { get; set; }

    /// <summary>The right panel (typically an OdsDonut with Layout=Stack).</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? Second { get; set; }

    /// <summary>Alternative free-form content when not using First/Second.</summary>
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }
}
